# Firmware images and card backups are NEVER committed.
#
# Vendor images are copyrighted redistribution. Card dumps carry personal save
# data. Both are large enough to poison a git history permanently. The image
# store lives outside this repository and is addressed by SHA-256 from
# devices/*/firmware.yaml — see README, "The binary boundary".
*.img
*.img.gz
*.img.xz
*.img.zst
*.iso
*.7z
*.zip
store/
backups/

# Instance data. This repository is public; agent session logs, neural pattern
# caches and policy state describe one machine's private working history and
# must never be published from here.
.claude-flow/
.swarm/
.agentic-qe/
*.rvf
*.rvf.*
.claude/settings.local.json

# macOS
.DS_Store
